        "body": "<p>There's a specific kind of helplessness in watching your dog come apart during a storm — the shaking, the panting, the way they press into you like you're the only solid thing left. You hold them, and it helps a little, until you have to let go.</p><p>We went looking for something that could keep holding them when we couldn't. What we found was the simple, well-understood idea that gentle, steady pressure can calm an anxious body. So we set out to make a vest around it — one that fits properly, goes on easily, and is soft enough to wear through a whole bad night.</p><p>Furvago is a small brand with a narrow focus: help dogs feel safe when the world feels like too much. That's the whole mission. No miracle claims — just a thoughtful thing that has helped a lot of dogs settle.</p>",
